    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Tier 3 — Peacekeeper Corps</strong></p><p><strong>“Order is a gift. Stop making us wrap it in barbed wire.”</strong></p><p>Peacekeepers are what you call them when you want them to sound noble. They build ceasefires, enforce boundaries, and take the blame when someone decides ‘peace’ was optional.</p><p><em>You are now a system inside the system. People feel you before they see you.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> You reroll the lowest die on Presence (Diplomacy) checks made to de-escalate violence or negotiate a surrender, and on checks to grapple or restrain.</li><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> —</li></ul>",
